From f61f17a434ffe22ed345f2ec93f4069ff1747032 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: smolemaru <axyenniiparen@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 02:48:13 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(providers): add OVHcloud AI Endpoints + Scaleway
 Generative APIs

Two EU-hosted free providers (TachiDesk vendor patch):

- OVHcloud AI Endpoints (platform 'ovh') - OpenAI-compatible at
  oai.endpoints.kepler.ai.cloud.ovh.net/v1. The anonymous tier needs NO
  key (~2 rpm; a key raises limits) - same placeholder-key convention as
  Pollinations/LLM7. Catalog ids PROBED LIVE 2026-06-10 against the
  keyless /v1/models (mind the mixed naming: Meta-Llama-3_3 with
  underscores vs Llama-3.1 with dots - that is the live spelling).
  Rows: Llama 3.3 70B, GPT-OSS 120B, Qwen3 Coder 30B, Llama 3.1 8B.
- Scaleway Generative APIs (platform 'scaleway') - OpenAI-compatible at
  api.scaleway.ai/v1, 1M free tokens with an IAM key (no card). Ids from
  the 2026-05 free-coding-models audit; the health probe remains the
  source of truth (a stale id just sinks in the fallback chain).

Touched: shared Platform union, provider registrations, keys-route
allowlist, KeysPage labels, models migration V12 (+fallback_config
backfill, same shape as V11).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
